 "headline": "LeBron And Maxey Bury Infamous Early",
 "notes": [
  "Gopher Gold has LeBron at 25 points, 10 boards, 12 dimes and Maxey at 30 on 12-of-21 shooting. theInfamous is bringing a Mo Bamba pickup.",
  "Thug Life just stole AST from MONSTARS, and MONSTARS' only answer so far is a De'Andre Hunter pickup that's keeping the score level at 5-5.",
  "Zero Fox Given got 32 and 14 from Giannis, then watched Brandon Ingram go 0-for-6 and hand the points straight back.",
  "White Mambas flipped AST on Adam Silver Dez Nuts, yet Ryan Rollins sits at 0-for-2 and Naz Reid is 4-for-12. The Mambas are winning in spite of themselves.",
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts lost AST and sits at 4-7 despite VJ Edgecombe's 18 points. Nobody else on that roster is helping him."
